1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,422
Buying tokenized stock is easy.

2
00:00:02,422 --> 00:00:05,206
But ownership still looks like a balance.

3
00:00:05,206 --> 00:00:10,012
Canopy turns a stock position into a collectible, transferable claim.

4
00:00:10,012 --> 00:00:13,994
Start with public xStocks or private-market PreStocks.

5
00:00:13,994 --> 00:00:18,930
Fund one asset instantly, or enter a group vault with USDC.

6
00:00:18,930 --> 00:00:22,706
This demo account owns seven pieces of Digital Matter.

7
00:00:22,706 --> 00:00:30,798
Every card points back to a vault record: claim percentage, current NAV, composition, and redemption state.

8
00:00:30,798 --> 00:00:32,422
The art can evolve.

9
00:00:32,422 --> 00:00:33,840
The claim cannot.

10
00:00:33,840 --> 00:00:35,283
Here is the moat.

11
00:00:35,283 --> 00:00:39,458
The collectible is not a profile picture layered on finance.

12
00:00:39,458 --> 00:00:46,585
It is the financial position, with identity assembled from allocation, ownership, market history, and time.

13
00:00:46,585 --> 00:00:48,749
And the vault is not frozen.

14
00:00:48,749 --> 00:00:55,760
Any owner can propose a new NAV composition, bond the change, and open PASS and FAIL positions.

15
00:00:55,760 --> 00:00:57,912
Traders price the decision.

16
00:00:57,912 --> 00:01:02,783
The time-weighted market chooses; silence preserves the current vault.

17
00:01:02,783 --> 00:01:04,613
PreStocks discovery.

18
00:01:04,613 --> 00:01:06,430
Pyth prices.

19
00:01:06,430 --> 00:01:08,143
Solana ownership.

20
00:01:08,143 --> 00:01:10,154
Bonded decision markets.

21
00:01:10,154 --> 00:01:14,922
Canopy makes stock ownership collectible, governable, and legible.

22
00:01:14,922 --> 00:01:16,456
Collect the market.

